{"title":"Thak Shieldbearer","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 56 Thak that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/thak-shield-boss\">Thak Shield Boss</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 4 looted corpses, 91 recorded drops, 13,698 total, 52–219 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-torso\" title=\"Titanium Torso - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/280b7b80b5d81046f763.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-longsword\" title=\"Titanium Longsword - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c1a26b20d934bb883929.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Longsword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-kryss\" title=\"Titanium Kryss - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/59f833ee7c52ee8c1c91.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-mace\" title=\"Gold Mace - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/163910b1c1e523fad89b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Mace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Inferior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-legs\" title=\"Titanium Legs - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/4e6f73bfebe5438ee961.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-4789.2px,-5047.8px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/17/19.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4352px;top:4864px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/17/20.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4352px;top:5120px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/18/19.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4608px;top:4864px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/18/20.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4608px;top:5120px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/19/19.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4864px;top:4864px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/19/20.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4864px;top:5120px\"><i style=\"left:4779.7px;top:5044.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:4798.7px;top:5051.2px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2353, 939 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2068, 1027 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2054, 860 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"thak-shieldbearer\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(2)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/shield-captain-vorsk\"><img src=\"data/img/4032e328046366254547.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Shield-Captain Vorsk</b><span>Lv 56</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/siegemaster-grukh\"><img src=\"data/img/4032e328046366254547.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Siegemaster Grukh</b><span>Lv 56 · trainer</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Thak: <a href=\"#/monster/thak-footman\">Thak Footman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-spearman\">Thak Spearman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-reaver\">Thak Reaver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran\">Thak Veteran</a> <span class=\"muted\">(68)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-warlord\">Thak Warlord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(75)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/e4f67001d17ee589aa8c.webp\" alt=\"Thak Shieldbearer\"></div><h3>Thak Shieldbearer</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>56 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 56–56)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Thak</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>389</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>35.3</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2800</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>4 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}